  "body": "Beautifully designed for contemporary lifestyles, this stylish residence offers the perfect blend of comfort, functionality, and easy-care living in the desirable Strathmill community of Orewa. Positioned on an approximately 190sqm section with an approximately 92sqm floor area, this thoughtfully crafted home presents an excellent opportunity for first-home buyers, growing families, professionals, or investors seeking a quality property with lasting appeal.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, creating a warm and welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining. The modern kitchen is both stylish and practical, featuring quality appliances, sleek cabinetry, generous bench space, and a well-considered layout designed to make meal preparation effortless.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors seamlessly connect the indoor living spaces to a spacious sun-drenched deck, extending the home's entertaining potential outdoors. Perfect for summer BBQs, relaxed family gatherings, or enjoying the fresh air, this private outdoor area adds another dimension to the home's appeal.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully designed with comfort in mind. The master suite provides a peaceful retreat, complete with a stylish ensuite. Two additional bedrooms offer excellent flexibility for children, guests, or a home office, while the beautifully appointed family bathroom features convenient dual access from both the hallway and one of the bedrooms, providing the option to transform the space into a convenient ensuite-style for added privacy and functionality. A separate laundry area further enhances the home's practicality and everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n-Central air-conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n-Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n-Pre wiring for EV Charger\r\n\r\nLocated within the fast-growing Strathmill community, this home enjoys the convenience of being close to Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping, schools, parks, and motorway connections. Surrounded by quality homes and a welcoming neighbourhood atmosphere, it offers the ideal balance of coastal lifestyle and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your first home, a smart investment opportunity, or a stylish property that offers an easy-care lifestyle, this exceptional residence is ready to impress.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
